+// Package unstablehook exposes internal helpers of the unstable package to
+// the rest of go-toml without making them part of the public API.
+package unstablehook
+
+// NewInlineTable is set by the unstable package. It takes a list of
+// KeyValue expression nodes (of type *unstable.Node) and returns a deep copy
+// of them wrapped in a synthetic InlineTable node (*unstable.Node). The
+// returned node does not depend on the parser's internal buffers, so it
+// remains valid after the parser moves on to the next expression.
+var NewInlineTable func(kvs []interface{}) interface{}
